# S-INFO-1: Defense-in-depth guard — prevent raw brain DB blobs from being committed.
# Option A (frozen-brain-snapshot) was explicitly rejected in the agentic-x183 Design
# precisely to avoid committing raw SQLite blobs. This .gitignore ensures that a
# careless --out *.sqlite or a copied brain can never be accidentally staged here.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-journal
